#. いや、霧切さんは<CLT 3>自分の部屋に入れた<CLT>はずだよ…
msgctxt "0001 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "No, Kyoko *could* have <CLT 3>gotten into her room<CLT>."
msgstr ""

#. それは…霧切さん自身も言ってたよね…？
msgctxt "0002 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "You said so yourself, didn't you Kyoko?"
msgstr ""

#. 正確に言えば違う…
#. あれは…
msgctxt "0003 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Actually, to be precise...not quite."
msgstr ""

#. …学園中のすべての鍵を解錠出来る
#. <CLT 3>“モノクマの秘密道具”<CLT>といったところかしら…
msgctxt "0004 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"I used <CLT 3>Monokuma's secret tool<CLT>, which can open any\n"
"lock in the school."
msgstr ""

#. は…！？
msgctxt "0005 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "What...!?"
msgstr ""

#. モノクマの秘密道具…？
msgctxt "0006 | AOI ASAHINA"
msgid "Monokuma's secret tool...?"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんが学園長室から盗み出した…
#. 学園内のすべての鍵を開けられる道具だよ。
msgctxt "0007 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Kyoko stole it from the headmaster's room. It lets you\n"
"get into any room in the school."
msgstr ""

#. それを使えば、
#. 霧切さんは自分の部屋に入れたはずなんだ。
msgctxt "0008 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid ""
"Which means, she could have used it to get into her\n"
"own room."
msgstr ""

#. ………………
msgctxt "0009 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "..."
msgstr "..."

#. どうやら、ここまでのようね…
msgctxt "0010 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "Then I guess that's it."
msgstr ""

#. 認めるんだな？　自分の罪を…
msgctxt "0011 | BYAKUYA TOGAMI"
msgid "You're giving up just like that? You admit to killing—"
msgstr ""

#. いいえ、私は自分の負けを認めただけよ…
msgctxt "0012 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "No, I'm simply recognizing that I lost."
msgstr ""

#. ど、どういう意味…？
msgctxt "0013 | TOUKO FUKAWA"
msgid "Wh-What are you talking about?"
msgstr ""

#. …たとえ<CLT 3>罠<CLT>だとしても、
#. その罠から抜け出せなかった以上は…
msgctxt "0014 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid ""
"Like I said, this was a <CLT 3>trap<CLT>. And I wasn't able to\n"
"escape it."
msgstr ""

#. 私の負け…
msgctxt "0015 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "So I lost..."
msgstr ""

#. そういう意味よ…
msgctxt "0016 | KYOUKO KIRIGIRI"
msgid "That's all this means."
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0017 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. じゃあ、もしかして…本当に…
msgctxt "0018 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Then...are you saying...? You really didn't...?"
msgstr ""

#. 本当に…霧切さんは…
msgctxt "0019 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "Kyoko, you really..."
msgstr ""

#. 犯人じゃ……
msgctxt "0020 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...aren't the killer?"
msgstr ""

#. はい！　<CLT 3>タイムアップ<CLT>でーす！！
msgctxt "0021 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Okaaay! <CLT 3>Time's up<CLT>!"
msgstr ""

#. …え？
msgctxt "0022 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "...Huh?"
msgstr ""

#. 残念だけど時間切れー！
#. 終わり、終わり。学級裁判は終わりだよ。
msgctxt "0023 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry to say, but your time is up! All done, all\n"
"finished. The class trial is allll over!"
msgstr ""

#. …タ、タイムアップなんておかしいよ！
#. だって今まで１度も、そんな事…
msgctxt "0024 | MAKOTO NAEGI"
msgid "B-But that's ridiculous! Since when is there any—?"
msgstr ""

#. 霧切さんが遅刻したせいだよ！
#. そのせいで、時間が押してんのッ！！
msgctxt "0025 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"It's because you were late! So the trial started late,\n"
"and time ran out!"
msgstr ""

#. …という訳で、そろそろ投票タイムといきましょうか！
#. オマエラ、お手元のスイッチで投票してくださーい！
msgctxt "0026 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"So then, it's time for voting time, okay? Everyone,\n"
"please vote using the lever in front of you!"
msgstr ""

#. もう、クロは決まり切ってるけどね…
msgctxt "0027 | MONOKUMA"
msgid ""
"But I guess we already know who the blackened is,\n"
"don't we!?"
msgstr ""

#. うぷ…ううぷぷぷぷぷぷぅ！！
msgctxt "0028 | MONOKUMA"
msgid "Puhuhu... Puuuhuhuhu!"
msgstr ""
